  1. T ∪ H_AI  — the explicit union of T and H_AI;
  2. T ∩ H_AI  — the explicit intersection of T and H_AI;
  3. (T ∪ H_AI) \ (T ∩ H_AI) — the resulting set after removing the intersection from the union, listing all member heading names.

